### Cadastrar atleta
POST http://localhost:8000/api/signup/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "pedro_corredor",
    "email": "pedro@runtrack.com",
    "password": "Trilha@123",
    "tipo": "ATLETA",
    "cidade": "Natal"
}


